   "text": "Most Databricks cost reviews I hear about end the same way.\n\nThe bill went up. Everyone has a theory. Nobody has an answer.\n\nMore workloads. Bigger data. A new team. All plausible, none proven. Then the same meeting happens again next quarter.\n\nThe gap is rarely effort. It's that the questions finance actually asks don't map to anything the platform team can pull up in five minutes.\n\nSo here's a quick poll. Which of these can nobody in your company answer right now?\n\nOn Thursday 15 October, BigHammer.ai founder and CEO Srinath Reddy is running a free live masterclass on exactly these questions: where the answers sit in your own billing data, and what to do about them.\n\nThe most-voted option gets extra time in the session.\n\nVote below, and the link to save a seat is in the first comment.\n\n#Databricks #FinOps #DataLeadership",
